@* ============================================================
   TokenDashboardRoot — the BlazorWebView root component behind
   Jabasoft's "Token verbruik" menu item. This is the ONE canonical
   token-usage view for the whole family: TabStudio/LocalAiStudio embed
   the exact same Jabasoft.Base.TokenUsageDashboard component (Blazor
   Server), and this renders it again unchanged (Blazor Hybrid) -
   Jabasoft used to have its own third, HTML/JS-only implementation
   (dashboard.html/dashboard.js), removed in favor of this.

   Reuses the shared .shell/.shell-header/.shell-menu grid classes from
   jabasoft-theme.css (loaded by wwwroot/index.html) so this reads as
   the same shell, not a different screen - "Terug" hands control back
   to the HTML shell via JabasoftHostBridge (see MainWindow.xaml.cs).

   Known gap: this page's own WebView2 instance doesn't share
   localStorage with the main shell's, so the LCARS/VS theme toggle set
   there doesn't carry over here yet - always starts on LCARS.
   ============================================================ *@
@using Jabasoft.Base
@inject JabasoftHostBridge HostBridge

<div class="shell">
    <header class="shell-header">
        <div class="jbs-header-title">JABASOFT — TOKEN VERBRUIK</div>
    </header>
    <aside class="shell-menu" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <nav class="nav">
            <button type="button" @onclick="() => HostBridge.BackToShell()">&larr; Terug</button>
        </nav>
        <div class="sidebar-foot"><span>alle apps</span></div>
    </aside>
    <main class="shell-content">
        <TokenUsageDashboard />
    </main>
    <div class="shell-actionrail"></div>
    <footer class="shell-footer"></footer>
</div>
